---
const cwMagnitude = Array.from({ length: 16 }, () => 1);
const ofdmMagnitude = [0.42, 0.68, 1.08, 0.54, 0.86, 1.72, 0.62, 0.35, 0.91, 1.28, 0.74, 0.48, 1.04, 0.58, 0.76, 0.51];
const width = 720;
const height = 360;
const left = 72;
const right = 28;
const top = 40;
const bottom = 58;
const x = (index: number) => left + index * (width - left - right) / (ofdmMagnitude.length - 1);
const y = (value: number) => height - bottom - value * (height - top - bottom) / 2;
const pathFor = (values: readonly number[]) => values.map((value, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x(index)} ${y(value)}`).join(' ');
const paprDb = (values: readonly number[]) => {
  const powers = values.map((value) => value ** 2);
  return 10 * Math.log10(Math.max(...powers) / (powers.reduce((sum, value) => sum + value, 0) / powers.length));
};
const cwPaprDb = paprDb(cwMagnitude);
const ofdmPaprDb = paprDb(ofdmMagnitude);
const peakIndex = ofdmMagnitude.indexOf(Math.max(...ofdmMagnitude));
const peakMagnitude = ofdmMagnitude[peakIndex] ?? 0;
---

<section class="cellular-visual envelope-papr" aria-labelledby="envelope-papr-title">
  <header class="cellular-visual__header">
    <div>
      <p>Linked envelope view</p>
      <h3 id="envelope-papr-title">CW의 일정한 envelope와 multi-tone 합성 peak는 PA headroom을 다르게 사용합니다.</h3>
    </div>
    <p class="cellular-model-note">16 samples · normalized Fs · no filter · 1× sampling · illustrative record</p>
  </header>

  <div class="constellation-guide__settings" aria-label="현재 도표 설정">
    <span>축: sample index / |x[n]| normalized</span>
    <span>CW PAPR: {cwPaprDb.toFixed(2)} dB</span>
    <span>example multi-tone PAPR: {ofdmPaprDb.toFixed(2)} dB</span>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${width} ${height}`} role="img" aria-labelledby="envelope-svg-title envelope-svg-desc">
    <title id="envelope-svg-title">CW와 교육용 multi-tone envelope 비교</title>
    <desc id="envelope-svg-desc">CW magnitude는 1로 일정하고, multi-tone 예는 sample 5에서 1.72의 peak를 가집니다.</desc>
    <rect width={width} height={height} class="plot-surface" />
    <g class="plot-grid" aria-hidden="true">
      {[0.5, 1, 1.5, 2].map((tick) => <line x1={left} x2={width - right} y1={y(tick)} y2={y(tick)} />)}
      {[0, 5, 10, 15].map((tick) => <line x1={x(tick)} x2={x(tick)} y1={top} y2={height - bottom} />)}
    </g>
    <g class="envelope-papr__axes" aria-hidden="true">
      <line x1={left} x2={width - right} y1={height - bottom} y2={height - bottom} />
      <line x1={left} x2={left} y1={top} y2={height - bottom} />
      <text x={width - right} y={height - 18} text-anchor="end">sample index n / sample</text>
      <text x={left + 10} y={top + 16}>|x[n]| / normalized</text>
      {[0.5, 1, 1.5, 2].map((tick) => <text x={left - 12} y={y(tick) + 4} text-anchor="end">{tick.toFixed(1)}</text>)}
      {[0, 5, 10, 15].map((tick) => <text x={x(tick)} y={height - bottom + 24} text-anchor="middle">{tick}</text>)}
    </g>
    <path d={pathFor(cwMagnitude)} class="plot-reference" />
    <path d={pathFor(ofdmMagnitude)} class="plot-forward" />
    <line x1={x(peakIndex)} x2={x(peakIndex)} y1={y(peakMagnitude)} y2={height - bottom} class="plot-marker" />
    <circle cx={x(peakIndex)} cy={y(peakMagnitude)} r="7" class="envelope-papr__marker" />
    <text x={x(peakIndex) + 12} y={y(peakMagnitude) - 12} class="plot-marker-label">M1 · peak 1.72</text>
    <text x={width - right - 8} y={y(1) - 10} text-anchor="end" class="envelope-papr__cw-label">CW · dashed · 0.00 dB</text>
    <text x={width - right - 8} y={y(ofdmMagnitude.at(-1) ?? 0) - 12} text-anchor="end" class="envelope-papr__ofdm-label">multi-tone · solid · {ofdmPaprDb.toFixed(2)} dB</text>
  </svg>

  <p class="cellular-visual-summary">관찰: 이 짧은 record에서 CW는 peak와 average가 같지만 multi-tone 합은 순간 peak를 만듭니다. 실제 PAPR·CCDF 비교에는 더 긴 record, filter, sample rate와 충분한 oversampling 조건이 필요합니다.</p>

  <details class="cellular-data-alternative">
    <summary>도표 데이터를 표로 보기</summary>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Trace</th><th>Record</th><th>Peak |x|</th><th>PAPR</th><th>제한</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><th>CW · dashed</th><td>16 samples</td><td>1.00</td><td>{cwPaprDb.toFixed(2)} dB</td><td>constant complex envelope</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Multi-tone · solid</th><td>16 samples</td><td>1.72 at n={peakIndex}</td><td>{ofdmPaprDb.toFixed(2)} dB</td><td>교육용 record; filtered/oversampled CCDF 아님</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </details>
</section>
